msgstr "Nun pudo abrise'l ficheru %1"

#: vpnc.cpp:156
msgid "Needed executable cisco-decrypt could not be found."
msgstr "Nun pudo alcontrase l'executable necesariu cisco-decrypt"

#: vpnc.cpp:268
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The VPN settings file '%1' specifies that VPN traffic should be tunneled "
"through TCP which is currently not supported in the vpnc software.\n"
"\n"
"The connection can still be created, with TCP tunneling disabled, however it "
"may not work as expected."
msgstr ""
"El ficheru d'axustes VPN '%1' especifica que tráficu VPN debería tuneliase "
"pente TCP qu'anguaño nun ta sofitáu nel software vpnc.\n"
"\n"
"La conexón pue crease entá, col tunel TCP deshabilitáu, por embargu podría "
"nun furrular como s'espera."

#: vpnc.cpp:268
msgid "Not supported"
msgstr "Ensin sofitu"

